WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.330
Cat licked a paw.

2
00:00:07.331 --> 00:00:10.288
"Let's look for Ann," she said.

3
00:00:10.289 --> 00:00:12.977
"Dirk is Ann's father.

4
00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:16.695
She might know what to do."

5
00:00:16.696 --> 00:00:26.507
"Good idea, Cat," Tom said.

6
00:00:26.508 --> 00:00:40.446
He rushed into the castle.

7
00:00:40.447 --> 00:00:47.237
A servant was polishing a suit of armor.

8
00:00:47.238 --> 00:00:51.791
Tom leaned on another suit of armor.

9
00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:55.521
"I'm looking for Ann," he said.

10
00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:58.326
"Watch out!" the servant yelled.

11
00:00:58.327 --> 00:01:01.115
The armor crashed to the floor.

12
00:01:01.116 --> 00:01:05.145
"Oops," Tom said. "Sorry!"

13
00:01:05.146 --> 00:01:18.358
The servant did not know where Ann was.

14
00:01:18.359 --> 00:01:20.687
Tom saw another servant.

15
00:01:20.688 --> 00:01:23.699
She was on a ladder and holding candles.

16
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.656
"Excuse me!" Tom called.

17
00:01:27.657 --> 00:01:29.485
He bumped into the ladder.

18
00:01:29.486 --> 00:01:31.346
The servant fell off!

19
00:01:31.347 --> 00:01:36.252
"Oops," said Tom. "Sorry!"

20
00:01:36.253 --> 00:01:43.808
None of the servants knew where Ann was.

21
00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:47.029
Finally Cat had another idea.

22
00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:51.084
"I know some secret spots in the palace," she said.

23
00:01:51.085 --> 00:01:53.104
"I'll look around inside.

24
00:01:53.105 --> 00:02:09.639
You can try outside."

25
00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:15.394
Cat crept all around the palace.

26
00:02:15.395 --> 00:02:22.521
But Cat did not see Ann anywhere.

27
00:02:22.522 --> 00:02:26.719
Tom looked around outside.

28
00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:32.130
He did not see Ann either.

29
00:02:32.131 --> 00:02:39.753
Finally he went to the Royal Stables.

30
00:02:39.754 --> 00:02:44.672
He woke up the stable boy.

31
00:02:44.673 --> 00:02:48.733
"Do you know where Ann is?" Tom asked.

32
00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:54.596
"No." The stable boy yawned.

33
00:02:54.597 --> 00:02:59.452
"But I heard some news about her father.

34
00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:07.989
Dirk has something big to tell everyone!"

